        "retrievedAt": "2026-11-14T03:16:54.446Z",
        "excerpt": "1973: Sydney Opera House opens\n\n...\n\nSince its opening in 1973 it has become a symbol the world immediately associates with Sydney and Australia.\n\n...\n\nFinally, the Sydney Opera House was opened by Queen Elizabeth II on 20 October 1973. It was 10 years overdue and, at $102 million, 14 times the original budget.",
        "contentBasis": "highlight",
        "sourceGroup": "nma.gov.au",
        "echoGroup": null,
        "sourceRole": "unknown",
        "directlyAddressesClaim": true,
        "matchesTimePlaceAndPopulation": true,
